sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Frontend as Frontend<br/>(Public Client)
    participant Hydra as Ory Hydra
    participant Attacker

    Frontend->>Frontend: Generate random code_verifier
    Frontend->>Frontend: Create code_challenge<br/>BASE64URL(SHA256(code_verifier))
    Note over Frontend: Keep code_verifier in the client

    Frontend->>Hydra: Authorization request<br/>code_challenge + method S256
    Hydra-->>Frontend: Authorization code

    Attacker->>Hydra: Exchange stolen code<br/>without code_verifier
    Hydra-->>Attacker: Reject token request

    Frontend->>Hydra: Exchange code + code_verifier
    Hydra->>Hydra: Verify code_verifier<br/>matches code_challenge
    Hydra-->>Frontend: Access token + ID token

    Note over Frontend,Hydra: A stolen authorization code is unusable without the original code_verifier
